{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About this game:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Croissant is an interactive clicker game where you need to click the croissant to earn more croissants. Incredible, isn't it?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have a good time and relax with simplistic gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become first in the leaderboard!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand and complete the collection of all Croissants!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200+ Croissant skins </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 25+ Upgrades </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for mouse, keyboard and gamepad </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New content added regularly </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 90+ Steam achievements </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam cloud save </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An inventory and list to track the evolution of your collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chill Lo-Fi soundtrack</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(Croissant is a game about collecting skins, and not a game based on the principle of item resale, NFT, scam... We remind you that all skins are dropable in-game and that no skin has a limited duration.)</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"1!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3070330/b0230856376d5d3892c9c2abb209de91ba242470.jpg"},{"name":"10!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3070330/ab75d881764111bfd445d3ad38e3a34c6404df35.jpg"},{"name":"100!","pa